          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wot a dano we, nen jo me ot Icrael tye ka kobo gin ame otye ka nyutti-ni kede kop ame yin itye ka kobo, tye pi kare ame pwod bor meicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi mannono ba, kobbigi kop man ame an Rwot Obaŋa akobo: Mom tye kopporo ame an akobo ame pwod dok bino gal, ento ginnoro luŋ ame an akobo bino doŋ timere. Man kop ame Rwot Obaŋa okobo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.28",
